{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A simple 2D action puzzle game that conveys waves to lead you to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make full use of scaffolding blocks that can be shaken like waves to reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game consists of 14 worlds with 5 stages per world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can control a square character. The stage is cleared when the goal is touched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The scaffolding in each stage consists of blocks that can be shaken like waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By using the waves, it is possible to reach places that are out of reach of ordinary jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make full use of the various properties of the waves is the key to solving the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578960/extras/WaveLeadsYou_icon.gif?t=1744684461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are various gimmicks on the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gimmicks may interfere with the player or may be necessary to conquer the stage.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578960?t=1744684461","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578960/59721c0def84534d6d9f7770950f042a9de775c9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744684461","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578960/9f681cf05b991277ec597286c4ea2578f6068f47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744684461","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578960/9f681cf05b991277ec597286c4ea2578f6068f47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744684461","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":